{"unit_id":"d3vmeh__dsh-fetch-timeouts#card-zh","repo":"d3vmeh/dsh-fetch-timeouts","commit":"2b4e09b350e93bb2b61d0c4a25f5bb5bbaa60a68","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-fetch-timeouts**（DSH 插件，适用于使用 Node 全局 fetch 的客户端）：为整个 DSH 进程延长 HTTP 响应头和响应体等待时间，帮助较慢的本地模型完成长请求。它包装当前 Undici 全局 dispatcher，为未单独设超时的请求补上 headersTimeoutMs 和 bodyTimeoutMs，默认均为 30 分钟，并保留原有路由。两个毫秒配置可在 Cordis patch 调整，设为 0 可关闭对应计时。适合使用 Ollama、LM Studio 等慢速后端的用户；不需要 API key 或额外账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:7-12","src/index.js:19-26","src/index.js:41-50","cordis.patch.yml:9-11"]}
{"unit_id":"d3vmeh__dsh-fetch-timeouts#card-en","repo":"d3vmeh/dsh-fetch-timeouts","commit":"2b4e09b350e93bb2b61d0c4a25f5bb5bbaa60a68","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Extends timeouts for DSH's global fetch. It wraps Undici's dispatcher, adding configurable header and body limits (30 minutes by default) only when a request has no override. Existing routing stays in place. Configure both in Cordis patch. Useful for slow local models; no API key or account needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:7-12","src/index.js:19-26","src/index.js:41-50","cordis.patch.yml:9-11"]}
